00:07:26.412 --> 00:07:28.815
I mean, I had failures in the past, but,

00:07:29.749 --> 00:07:32.218
you know, in my career,

00:07:32.218 --> 00:07:34.020
I mean, this is like

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:35.087
a whole different ballgame.

00:07:35.087 --> 00:07:35.521
This is like

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:37.657
