00:09:08.147 --> 00:09:10.816
I did not say that heaven is a fantasy.

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:14.053
I said that heaven, as it is explained

00:09:14.053 --> 00:09:15.755
a lot of times, is a fantasy

00:09:15.755 --> 00:09:17.490
that you and I will meet

00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:20.192
in 50 years from now.

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:21.527
We will be up there

00:09:21.527 --> 00:09:23.429
and doing interviews again.

00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:25.698
But in heaven, it's not going to happen.

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:27.700
There will be.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.235
So I believe in heaven

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.570
and I believe in God.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.170
And all of this

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.438
if I just don't think

00:09:32.438 --> 00:09:34.073
that it will be in the same form.

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:35.174
That's what I was saying.

00:09:35.174 --> 00:09:36.609
But I mean, you know,

00:09:36.609 --> 00:09:38.945
and I hate the age of

00:09:38.945 --> 00:09:41.047
the idea of getting old

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:44.283
and I hate the idea of dying.

00:09:44.283 --> 00:09:45.318
I think it's very simple

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:46.686
because, I mean,

00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:49.155
look at the life I've had.

00:09:49.155 --> 00:09:50.723
Look at this life.

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:52.725
I mean, it's like, unbelievable.

00:09:53.793 --> 00:09:56.329
And and to have a life like that,

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:59.098
and then eventually it will end.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.069
I mean, it's just the lifestyle.

